import R4333Lean.ProfileDUUUDegreeTenCatalogLeafBridgeUUU2P15

/-!
# Explicit orbit witnesses for all nine block-two support pairs

Each of the nine tables has 600 packed normalizers.  For a word `w`,
`w % 600` is the representative row and the next three base-ten digits are
the free, first-support, and second-support action indices.  Subsequent
modules kernel-check the matrix equations in bounded chunks.
-/

